   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to authorize the widower of Jeannette M. Feminella to file a retirement\noption election form",
    "basePrintNo": "S6730",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6730-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Retirement",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S6730\n\nSPONSOR: BOYLE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to authorize the widower of Jeannette M. Feminella to file a\nretirement option election form\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis bill will permit Dominic J. Feminella, the widower of Jeannette M.\nFeminella, to change the retirement option of his wife.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1. Authorizes Dominic J. Feminella, the widower of Jeanette M.\nFeminella, to file an election to change her originally executed retire-\nment option with the New York state teachers' retirement system to 100\npercent survivor on his late wife's behalf.\n\nSection 2. Establishes effective date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nMs. Feminella retired on June 17, 2016 and died on July 7, 2016. Prior\nto her death on July 7, 2016, Ms. Feminella completed an election to\nchange her originally executed retirement option to 100% survivor.  The\nchange of election form was ultimately received by the retirement system\non July 9, 2017. Unfortunately, Ms. Feminella died before the change of\nelection form was received by the New York State Teachers' Retirement\nSystem. The bill would allow Dominic J. Feminella, the widower of Jean-\nette M. Feminella, to file the election on her behalf.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2020: S. 5996- Referred to Civil Service and Pensions / A. 7448-\nReferred to Governmental Employees\n\n2019: S. 5996- Referred to Civil Service and Pensions / A. 7448-\nReferred to Governmental Employees\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nSee Fiscal Note.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act would take effect immediately\n",
